# Git Workflow Rules

Use Git from the beginning.

Before large changes, propose a plan.

Make small commits.

Use commit messages:
- feat:
- fix:
- refactor:
- docs:
- test:
- chore:

Never delete large amounts of code without explaining why.

After major changes, update:
- docs/BUILD_LOG.md
- docs/DECISIONS.md if architecture changed
- docs/IDEAS_INBOX.md only for future ideas

Always summarize:
- files changed
- how to test
- next recommended step
